      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR ZENA (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Q Parklands in a handy 30.17 beating Paw Queston. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. IMPRESSIVE GEM (8) was favourite last start and led all the way, scoring by 3.5 lengths (23.49) at this track in a Grade 5 over 411m. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Sure to measure up. WISHING STAR (3) stalked the lead from a low draw and fought on well to finish 3.5 lengths back in third (25.62) at Q Lakeside in a OPEN over 457m. Likely to be in the finish again. ASTON TOLHURST (2) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at his latest outing at this circuit.",
